{"ref":"BDB, שְׂרָיָה(וּ)","hw":"שְׂרָיָה(וּ)","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרָיָה(וּ)</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>persisteth</em> Dr<sup>HastDict. Bib. ii. 530 Jacob</sup><strong>)</strong>;—usually Σαραια(ς);—<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרָיָה</span>:<br><strong>1.</strong>  secretary of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.17\">2 S 8:17</a>, but 𝔊<sup>B</sup> Ασα, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שיא</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.25\">20:25</a> Kt (<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁוָא</span> Qr), <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁוְשָׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.16\">1 Ch 18:16</a> (in both Ἰησοῦς, 𝔊L Σουσα), <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁישָׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.3\">1 K 4:3</a> (Σαβα, A Σεισα, 𝔊L Σαφατ); orig. in all prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">ששא</span> We Dr Klo (<em>Sausa</em>), HPS <span dir=\"rtl\">(שושא)</span>, Now, Bu.<br><strong>2.</strong>  chief priest <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.18\">2 K 25:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.24\">Je 52:24</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a captain <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.23\">2 K 25:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">Je 40:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:59\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.59\">51:59</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:61\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.61\">61</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  son of Ḳenaz <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.13\">1 Ch 4:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.14\">14</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  name in Simeon v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.35\">35</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  Levite name 5:40<sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>5.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  companion of Zerub. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:2\" href=\"/Ezra.2.2\">Ezr 2:2</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  father of <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:1\" href=\"/Ezra.7.1\">Ezra 7:1</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  one sealed <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.3\">Ne 10:3</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  priest <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.11\">11:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.1\">12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.12\">12</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרָיָהוּ</span>, officer of king Jehoiakim, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.26\">Je 36:26</a>, τῷ Σαρεα.","next":"BDB, שׂרה","prev":"BDB, יִשְׂרְאֵלִי"}